  "description": "Terminal emulator scenario corpus for the spocky-terminal emulator decision. Each scenario feeds PTY output bytes into an emulator sized rows x cols with 1000 lines of scrollback. Ops: text (UTF-8 bytes of the string), hex (raw bytes), repeat (text with %d replaced by the zero-based index, count times, as one chunk), resize (cols, rows). Bytes reach the emulator chunk by chunk exactly as listed.",
